     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi folks,<div><br></div><div>Late notice (apologies!) but we are having a presentation currently by Alicja Gosiewska on using XAI (see below!). She&#39;s visiting from Poland and we are happy to have her present today! <span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Alicja Gosiewska (<a href=\"https://github.com/agosiewska\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/agosiewska&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465589441000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2CV6LO058w7BD4PtyP0OJ6\">https://github.com/agosiewska</a></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;white-space:pre-wrap\">) is a Ph.D. student at Warsaw University of Technology in Poland, currently visiting The Genome and Biomedical Sciences Facility. </span><br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;white-space:pre-wrap\">&quot;I work in the MI2 Data Lab group (</span><a href=\"http://mi2.mini.pw.edu.pl/\" style=\"font-family:Arial;white-space:pre-wrap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mi2.mini.pw.edu.pl/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465589441000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3d_7NdkLdNjMq9IcDlYSyT\">http://mi2.mini.pw.edu.pl/</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;white-space:pre-wrap\">) where currently we are focusing on the field of Explainable Artificial Intelligence (XAI). Our research aims to develop methods that help to understand how complex machine learning models work and to increase the trust in their predictions. An overview of our work can be found at </span><a href=\"http://jmlr.org/papers/v19/18-416.html\" style=\"font-family:Arial;white-space:pre-wrap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://jmlr.org/papers/v19/18-416.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465589441000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2KAKf7wbF_wk2S8qXli2NO\">http://jmlr.org/papers/v19/18-416.html</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;white-space:pre-wrap\">. We also develop many R packages for XAI (</span><a href=\"http://drwhy.ai/\" style=\"font-family:Arial;white-space:pre-wrap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://drwhy.ai/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465589441000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0aS1l7KVC9p5qUfRBQ2cj5\">http://drwhy.ai</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;white-space:pre-wrap\">).&quot;</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;white-space:pre-wrap\">Zoom link for presentation is here:</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><a href=\"https://zoom.us/j/375570526\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://zoom.us/j/375570526&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465589441000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2QN3ePDh_TwSlbXNN8BndZ\">https://zoom.us/j/375570526</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><br></div><div>Notes/slides/materials:</div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/agosiewska/XAI-UC-Davis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/agosiewska/XAI-UC-Davis&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465589441000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2GKL6ju5wXiUqA1CKqZtWs\">https://github.com/agosiewska/XAI-UC-Davis</a><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>R</div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);display:inline\"><span> </span></span><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"></b></i></font></span><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><font size=\"1\"><i>&quot;When we try to pick out anything by itself, we find it hitched to everything else in the universe.&quot;<b><br>John Muir (My First Summer in the Sierra, 1911)</b></i></font></div><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b>-----------------------------------------------------</b></i></font></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-